            "options": ["Informative", "Directive", "Poetic", "Phatic"],
            "correctAnswer": "Phatic",
            "explanation": "The Phatic function is used to establish, maintain, or check social interaction. Small talk about the weather is a classic example of this social, connection-oriented function."
