            "options": ["First body paragraph", "Thesis statement", "Conclusion", "Topic sentence"],
            "correctAnswer": "Thesis statement",
            "explanation": "The thesis statement, typically located in the introduction, is a concise sentence that states the main argument or central idea of the entire essay."
